WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Black Fang Beads are immune to any fear

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,040
and rational attacks

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,200
Because it is irritable and irrational to begin with

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,560
Senior, I am a slave-level black tooth bead.

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,970
And it's not afraid of mental contamination.

6
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,540
It seems that there is still a difference between hiring and subduing

7
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:19,850
Ten days is okay, right?

8
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:22,050
Now we have white teeth and black teeth beads

9
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:24,050
The tight shoulder lines finally relaxed

10
00:00:24,370 --> 00:00:26,930
The safety at night is still guaranteed.

11
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:29,370
Hurry up and touch the box over here, and take it home.

12
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:30,770
Senior, go straight

13
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,210
We'll be there in about five hundred meters

14
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:33,850
Let the Black Tooth Pearl clear the way

15
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:37,930
Senior, what is the box moving?

16
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:39,090
Could it be that there is someone in front of me?

17
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:40,290
Go, go and have a look

18
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,970
I want to see who dares to steal my things
